        "msg": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "data": "\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\nQUESTION 11: Mixed-Signal Reviews\n\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\nReviews with 1-2 stars but containing positive keywords\n(Potential sarcastic reviews or mis-clicks)\n\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\n stars  positive_count                                                                             text\n     1              27 Crossing Vineyards has been here for a few years now and I\u0027ve had the chance ...\n     1              23 I  would stay away from the Reno Good Feet Store.   I was given a great deal ...\n     1              22 Not surprised Cava shut down.  The ambiance was great and gave the appearance...\n     1              22 I have been patiently waiting for a microwave to be installed since 8/12. Tha...\n     2              18 A few friends and I went out and wanted to grab a beer and a good burger. We ...\n     1              18 I always love coming to fox and hound because they are close by. Great beer s...\n     2              18 I have  lived  in reno  for I have lived in Reno since 65 and I started going...\n     1              18 pets best friend vet. hospital, run by vetcor is the very worst place, to tak...\n     2              17 Mediocre at best! Let\u0027s be real... if it wasn\u0027t for their location on the riv...\n     2              17 UPDATE:  Brunch is way overhyped. Had a miserable time at brunch. I went to R...\n     2              17 I have been anticipating the opening of this new location since I found out a...\n     2              17 My wife and I visited Frenchy\u0027s Rockaway Grill for dinner tonight.  I\u0027m a bor...\n     2              17 Another drop in the bucket Best Buy location.  Being from NY, the Best Buys a...\n     2              16 So if you want cheap prices it\u0027s an alright place, they have a good selection...\n     1              16 47 NOT!!! I am so sick of shitty customer service! What I want in a restauran...\n\u003cFigure size 720x432 with 0 Axes\u003e\n\u003cBarContainer object of 15 artists\u003e\nText(0.5, 0, \u0027Review Number\u0027)\nText(0, 0.5, \u0027Number of Positive Keywords\u0027)\nText(0.5, 1.0, \u0027QUESTION 11: Mixed-Signal Reviews - Positive Keywords Count\u0027)\n([\u003cmatplotlib.axis.XTick object at 0x75980f406260\u003e, \u003cmatplotlib.axis.XTick object at 0x75980f45a710\u003e, \u003cmatplotlib.axis.XTick object at 0x75980f2c2e00\u003e, \u003cmatplotlib.axis.XTick object at 0x75980f2c3790\u003e, \u003cmatplotlib.axis.XTick object at 0x75980f2ec430\u003e, \u003cmatplotlib.axis.XTick object at 0x75980f2ed090\u003e, \u003cmatplotlib.axis.XTick object at 0x75980f2edcf0\u003e, \u003cmatplotlib.axis.XTick object at 0x75980f2ecc10\u003e, \u003cmatplotlib.axis.XTick object at 0x75980f2eeb90\u003e, \u003cmatplotlib.axis.XTick object at 0x75980f2ef7f0\u003e, \u003cmatplotlib.axis.XTick object at 0x75980f10c490\u003e, \u003cmatplotlib.axis.XTick object at 0x75980f2eeda0\u003e, \u003cmatplotlib.axis.XTick object at 0x75980f1